      "side": 1,
      "message": "Intended. The lock only prevents opening a new connection once close has started. It doesn\u0027t wait for in-flight reads: SHUTDOWN closes their connections, they fail with an SQLException that is already caught and logged, and the request falls back to the loader. release() closes the handle instead of pooling it once the store is closed. Seemed to complex to instead drain connections on the close.",
